### USER REGISTER
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "miguel",
    "email": "miguel@gmail.com",
    "password": "miguel123"
}

### LOGIN USER
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "miguel@gmail.com",
   "password": "miguel123" 
}

### LOGOUT USER 
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/logout